--------------6.Max in sub array--------
---kadanes optimal way---
nums=[-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]
n=len(nums)
maxi = float("-inf")
total = 0 
for i in range(0,n):
  total += nums[i]
  maxi = max(maxi , total)
  if total < 0:
    total =0
print(maxi)

